# ── 站点构建产物（Astro 重建，2026-11-18）────────────────────
# Astro 的 outDir 是 dist/。public/ 是**静态资源源码**（favicon 等，入库），
# 里面同步进来的 images/ 与 js/ 是构建产物，不入库。
/platforms/blog/site/dist/
/platforms/blog/site/public/images/
/platforms/blog/site/public/js/
# 内容单元的站点副本（sync-content.py 同步进来的，不入库）
/platforms/blog/site/src/content/units/
# 学习流的编译结果（build-learning-path.py 编出来的，跟内容单元一样是产物）
/platforms/blog/site/data/learning-path.compiled.json
# 活动数据的编译结果（build-activity.py 编出来的；账本本身 activity.json 入库）
/platforms/blog/site/data/activity.compiled.json
# Astro 的类型缓存
/platforms/blog/site/.astro/
# 内容单元仓库：母稿编译出来的产物（规格 §4.2）。
# 它是**所有平台共用的那一半**——契约层与各平台 adapter 真正读的东西，
# 但它是 build product，所以不入库；CI 里现编。
/content/units/

# Dependencies
node_modules/
# Python 项目环境（类型检查与本地测试用；依赖清单在 requirements/）
.venv/

# OS
.DS_Store

# Editor
.vscode
.obsidian

# Misc
*.pdf
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# Isolated git worktrees for feature work (git worktree add .worktrees/<branch>).
# Ignored so a worktree checkout is never mistaken for repository content.
.worktrees/

# Superpowers scratch: SDD ledgers, task briefs, review packages.
.superpowers/

# Agent session scratch (pi/Claude session ids) — local bookkeeping only.
session.txt

# Media assets (audio / video) — never committed, kept on local disk only.
# A single finished cut is 15~35 MB; 100 episodes would be GB-scale, and a
# binary blob in git is unreadable in every diff and review. What belongs in
# the repo is the reproducible input (scripts, storyboard contract, subtitle
# styles), not the rendered output.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac

